ABOUT THE PRODUCT

Bohempia&nbsp;ZELEK,&nbsp;the timeless and&nbsp;incredibly versatile barefoot essential&nbsp;that you'll definitely get a lot of use out of! These are&nbsp;Chukka-style ankle-high boots in a barefoot version. Sustainable and vegan with a 100% hemp canvas upper and 4 mm thin, ultra-flexible,&nbsp;natural rubber outsole.&nbsp;

Chukka&nbsp;boots are a casual footwear style that is an excellent alternative to styles such as Chelsea boots, or sneakers. There aren’t too many hard-and-fast rules when it comes to styling Chukka boots. Their versatility is legendary, and it’s a big reason they’ve stayed in style since the 1940s. It all depends on whether you want to dress them up or dress them down.

Available in two widths: regular and extra wide. For more info, please see our size guide here.

MATERIALS AND PRODUCTION


Upper: Hemp canvas
Lining: Cotton&nbsp;
Laces: Cotton
Sole: 4 mm, natural rubber
Construction: Glued + vulcanized&nbsp;
Origin: Made in Romania


BAREFOOT FEATURES


Thin, flexible sole for better ground feel&nbsp;
Zero-drop construction (consistent sole thickness under the heel and toes) for natural posture and gait&nbsp;
Spacious toe box for healthy foot shape&nbsp;


